    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d500">

                <pb facs="0484" n="474" xml:id="pg474"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/11–948: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Stuart</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-01-08T13:00:00-05:00">January 8, 1949—1
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>29. Dept desires supplemental report losses suffered by ChiGovt subsequent to
                    losses reported Embtel 2142 Nov 9.<anchor n="8" xml:id="d500-f1"/> Request Emb
                    periodically forward such report providing info as requested Deptel 1527 Nov
                        2.<anchor n="9" xml:id="d500-f2"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lovett</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
